Package: sherlock-search
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gautham Palaniappan <gauthampalaniappan@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: plocate, xdg-utils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/gauthampalaniappan/sherlock
Description: Search applications, files, and the web from one small window
 A small search window in the spirit of classic Mac OS Sherlock. Type, and
 results update from installed applications, files (plocate or Tracker when
 available, or a short folder scan), and a single "Search the web" action
 that opens DuckDuckGo in your browser.
 .
 Installed as "sherlock-search" so it does not collide with the unrelated
 "sherlock" username-search package.
